    A batch is running. Quit anyway?
quit-sequence-running
    A grow sequence is being written. Quit anyway?
quit-stack-running
    A stack is running. Quit anyway?
quit-description
    Quitting cancels it. Every render already made is kept, with any files exported and sequence frames written so far.
quit-button
    Quit
quit-waiting
    Saving files. Deptheos quits once they are written.
quit-saving-retouching
    Saving your retouching. Deptheos quits once it is saved.
quit-paint-unsaved
    Your latest retouching couldn't be saved. Quit anyway?
quit-paint-unsaved-description
    Quitting loses the retouching not yet saved. To keep it, cancel, make room on the Library's disk or reconnect it, then quit again.
quit-anyway-button
    Quit Anyway
